issues.fix_suggestion:
Replace forward declarations with actual header includes, e.g.:
  #include <aws/common/common.h>
  #include <aws/http/http.h>
Then use the real types and function declarations from those headers. If CMakeDeps include dir propagation is broken, fix the recipe's cpp_info settings (e.g., ensure transitive include dirs propagate via cpp_info.requires) rather than working around it in the test.
